<view class="page-head"><view class="head-kicker">本月 · 教学回顾</view><view class="head-title">授课回顾</view><view class="head-subtitle">从一次次打卡，看见这个月的积累。</view></view>
<view class="month-hero"><view class="hero-label">本月实际授课</view><view class="hero-value">{{monthRealHours}}<text>小时</text></view><view class="hero-caption">已完成 {{monthClasses}} 节课 · 来自授课打卡</view><view class="hero-rule"></view><view class="hero-footer">每一小时，都是陪伴成长的时间。</view></view>
<view class="stats-grid"><view class="stat-card"><view class="stat-index">授课记录</view><view class="stat-num">{{monthClasses}}<text class="stat-unit">节</text></view><view class="stat-label">本月已打卡</view></view><view class="stat-card"><view class="stat-index">课后反馈</view><view class="stat-num">{{feedbackCount}}<text class="stat-unit">条</text></view><view class="stat-label">本月新建反馈</view></view><view class="stat-card"><view class="stat-index">固定安排</view><view class="stat-num">{{weekCourses}}<text class="stat-unit">节</text></view><view class="stat-label">每周固定课程</view></view><view class="stat-card"><view class="stat-index">计划课时</view><view class="stat-num">{{weekHours}}<text class="stat-unit">小时</text></view><view class="stat-label">每周固定计划课时</view></view></view>
<view class="card tips"><view class="tips-title">关于这一页的数字</view><view class="muted">实际授课来自打卡记录。每周固定计划不包含指定日期的临时课程。本月反馈按创建时间统计。</view></view>
